REQUIREMENTS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
- Pure Python + standard ML libs only (no LLMs, no OpenAI, no langchain)
- Cluster labels from DBSCAN should be added as a column "Cluster_ID"
  in Overlap and Exact tabs so grouped processes are visible
- All pairs must be evaluated — not just within clusters
- overlap_pct = (|intersection| / |smaller set|) * 100
  so subset shows 100% even if Jaccard < 1
- Add docstrings to every function
- Add a CLI entrypoint:
  python process_rationalization.py --input input.json --output output.xlsx
- Wrap main() in if __name__ == "__main__"
- Handle edge cases: single process, all identical, all disjoint

